# The live advance targets the allocator head rather than the activation's
# highest own applied append, so it passes an entry another writer appended after
# the activation's last own append, which no response has reported.
MODULE: ReadPositionHonestAdvanceToHead
TARGET: ReadPositionHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the live advance moves the read position to the allocator head
PERTURBS: LiveAdvance

--- FIND
    /\ Max(mine[a]) > rp[a]
    /\ rp' = [rp EXCEPT ![a] = Max(mine[a])]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the target is the head, not the highest own append.
    /\ next - 1 > rp[a]
    /\ rp' = [rp EXCEPT ![a] = next - 1]
--- END
